stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> PENDING_CONFIRMATION : tool proposes consequential action
  PENDING_CONFIRMATION --> CANCELLED : customer says NO or sends a new request
  PENDING_CONFIRMATION --> EXPIRED : TTL elapsed
  PENDING_CONFIRMATION --> AWAITING_APPROVAL : YES and policy needs human approval
  PENDING_CONFIRMATION --> EXECUTED : YES and adapter confirms
  PENDING_CONFIRMATION --> FAILED : YES and adapter refuses
  PENDING_CONFIRMATION --> OUTCOME_UNKNOWN : YES but no authoritative answer
  AWAITING_APPROVAL --> EXECUTED : operator approves and adapter confirms
  AWAITING_APPROVAL --> REJECTED : operator rejects
  OUTCOME_UNKNOWN --> EXECUTED : reconcile finds success
  OUTCOME_UNKNOWN --> FAILED : reconcile finds failure
  EXECUTED --> [*]
  FAILED --> [*]
  CANCELLED --> [*]
  EXPIRED --> [*]
  REJECTED --> [*]
